# The review pair. Every pull request has exactly two reviewers: the Opus bot
# always, and `second`, which is `cursor` or `sonnet`. The Claude Review
# workflow reads `second` from the base branch, and the merge rule
# (.claude/skills/agentrealm-agents-fixer/SKILL.md, The review verdict) reads
# the logins. Only Evan edits this file.
#
# While Cursor is out of credits: set `second: sonnet` and turn off Cursor's
# review automation. When credits return, reverse both.
#
# A flip strands open pull requests: none has a review from the new second
# reviewer until its review is triggered again. The supervisor re-runs Claude
# Review on them after a flip to `sonnet`; after a flip to `cursor`, it names
# the ones Cursor still has to review.
opus: opus-review-agent[bot]
sonnet: sonnet-review-agent[bot]
cursor: cursor[bot]
second: sonnet
